 "name": "ST54EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "The Argama",
  "was nearing lunar orbit,",
  "about to make contact with Axis,",
  "the space fortress",
  "of the Zeon remnants.",
  "Axis was",
  "the fortress used as a base",
  "by Zeon forces who escaped",
  "from A Baoa Qu,",
  "and of all the organized",
  "Zeon remnant forces, it was",
  "without question the largest.",
  "It was an open secret",
  "among the AEUG leadership",
  "that Quattro Bajeena,",
  "in truth Char Aznable,",
  "was the very man",
  "who had come from Axis",
  "to Anaheim seeking aid",
  "in the first place.",
  "Since both of them",
  "had the Titans for an enemy,",
  "it was only natural",
  "to want to explore",
  "some kind of fighting alliance.",
  "Then, moving parallel",
  "to the Argama's course,",
  "Scirocco's Dogosse Giar",
  "was detected.",
  "These were Titans who had already",
  "absorbed the Republic of Zeon.",
  "For the sake of their ambitions,",
  "it seemed no surprise if they",
  "struck an unholy pact with Zeon,",
  "their original quarry.",
  "The plan was to strike first",
  "and crush them before that.",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"Now, of all times? What is it?\"",
  "Quattro",
  "\"I need to talk to you.\"",
  "\"I'll go",
  " to the briefing room",
  " right away.\"",
  "\"No, that's all right.",
  " This is something",
  " I want to ask you directly...\"",
  "\"Another dangerous mission?\"",
  "\"You know we've upgraded",
  " the Hyaku Shiki's",
  " Mega Bazooka Launcher, right?\"",
  "\"Its energy pack needs",
  " a whole mobile suit's worth,",
  " doesn't it?\"",
  "\"Mm... For that pack,",
  " I want to use the Methuss.\"",
  "\"You're going to snipe",
  " Scirocco?\"",
  "\"You figured it out? Impressive...\"",
  "\"Mm... I have one condition...\"",
  "\"A condition?\"",
  "Reccoa sought Char's lips,",
  "and Char gently",
  "kissed hers.",
  "\"...We launch in 15 minutes.\"",
  "\"Yes...\"",
  "\"Hah... He didn't take off",
  " his sunglasses.",
  " So that's Lieutenant Quattro...\"",
  "Mobile Suit Sniping",
  "Republic of Zeon",
  "The idea of sniping",
  "with mobile suits",
  "was not a particularly new one.",
  "It came mostly from the Federation,",
  "which favored traditional tactics.",
  "In space and on the ground alike,",
  "Zeon stressed close assaults",
  "with handheld weapons,",
  "but the Federation, having to run",
  "its MS alongside older warships,",
  "stressed long-range sniping.",
  "Then again, the early forms",
  "were carried out amid interference",
  "from Minovsky particles,",
  "and there were limits",
  "to how far a mobile suit",
  "could be made to carry",
  "a long-range beam weapon,",
  "so, much as in infantry combat,",
  "it is thought to have been sniping",
  "as a mere extension of eyesight.",
  "It was, if anything,",
  "a master's craft; no",
  "\"sniper mobile suit\" category",
  "was ever brought into",
  "the war itself.",
  "There were machines called",
  "\"Sniper Customs,\" but they",
  "were no more than units suited",
  "to long-range support.",
  "Deadly one-sided sniping",
  "from beyond the target's sensors,",
  "at extreme telephoto range,",
  "was made possible by",
  "Minovsky interference radar,",
  "high-precision optical sensors,",
  "and the development of",
  "mega condensers that could store",
  "vast amounts of energy",
  "and mega particles.",
  "Beam guns of this kind",
  "were known as mega launchers.",
  "With these, a gun that could sink",
  "a battleship in one shot, quite",
  "literally, could be hauled wherever",
  "needed on a mobile suit's mobility",
  "and used to snipe",
  "with great stealth;",
  "such was the tactic that",
  "now became possible.",
  "It was, in a sense, a scaled-down",
  "version of the fleet-battle cannon",
  "tested early in the One Year War.",
  "The Mega Bazooka Launcher",
  "carried by the Hyaku Shiki",
  "was one of these.",
  "It carried a fusion reactor",
  "equal to one mobile suit's,",
  "and was driven by the Hyaku Shiki",
  "and one more mobile suit;",
  "it was expected to pierce even",
  "the beam-disruption screen that",
  "guards a battleship, and sink the",
  "Dogosse Giar from extreme range.",
  "Having won independence in the",
  "armistice of 0080, the Republic of",
  "Zeon was the state that took up",
  "the mantle of the Principality.",
  "It was, after a fashion,",
  "the first colony state recognized",
  "by the Earth Federation, but in",
  "truth pro-Federation factions",
  "held the parliament and had driven",
  "out the Zabi faction; it was",
  "a satellite state in all but name.",
  "For that reason, activists who",
  "cried for war to the bitter end,",
  "Aiguille Delaz for one,",
  "reviled it as a Federation puppet,",
  "a sham of a nation.",
  "Even so, the Side 3 homeland",
  "had taken no damage at all,",
  "and so, putting its industry",
  "to use, it is thought",
  "to have built up",
  "considerable wealth.",
  "The treaty banned it",
  "from developing",
  "new mobile suits, but",
  "buying them was not banned,",
  "so it purchased new models",
  "from Anaheim and others",
  "and worked to build up",
  "its own military strength.",
  "It was by no means",
  "a mere part of the Federation.",
  "What the Republic feared most",
  "in the civil war between",
  "the AEUG and the Titans",
  "was being seen as AEUG backers,",
  "suffering armed intervention,",
  "and watching the independence",
  "it had won at last vanish.",
  "So they made secret pacts",
  "with Jamitov and Scirocco",
  "and cooperated with them.",
  "That A Baoa Qu,",
  "a former fortress,",
  "though under the control",
  "of the Federation Forces,",
  "was handed over so readily",
  "was likely a sign of this.",
  "To protect the peace and",
  "independence they had won,",
  "they were ready to do anything.",
  "It was at just such a time",
  "that Axis returned.",
  "Scirocco",
  "\"Might alone won't win a battle.\"",
  "\"You came to the Dogosse Giar",
  " because you wanted to know why,",
  " Lieutenant. Am I wrong?\"",
  "Yazan",
  "\"Hmph...\"",
  "After the battle",
  "in Earth orbit,",
  "Scirocco had pulled",
  "the Yazan Gable team, Sarah too,",
  "onto the Dogosse Giar.",
  "\"Because I am aboard,",
  " the Dogosse Giar holds",
  " a different kind of power.\"",
  "\"That you sensed it",
  " shows splendid instincts.\"",
  "\"Heh!",
  " Paptimus Scirocco,",
  " you're an interesting one.\"",
  "\"Mm... Heh heh...\"",
  "Soldier",
  "\"Enemy, 40 degrees starboard!\"",
  "\"Do you feel it, Sarah?\"",
  "Sarah",
  "\"I feel as if I know it.\"",
  "\"From the Argama?\"",
  "\"It would have to be...\"",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "The Argama's mobile suit team",
  "took a course to meet the",
  "Dogosse Giar's interceptors.",
  "To cover the Hyaku Shiki's sniping.",
  "Kamille",
  "\"The enemy's moving too.",
  " And the laser jamming",
  " is heavy...\"",
  "\"Ensign Reccoa,",
  " you can't see them either, right?\"",
  "\"We'll just have to rely",
  " on our eyes and instincts...\"",
  "\"The Hyaku Shiki and Methuss",
  " are leaving the course.\"",
  "\"Gundam and the rest,",
  " spread out on all sides.\"",
  "\"Kamille,",
  " stay out of the Mega Bazooka",
  " Launcher's line of fire!\"",
  "The Dogosse Giar,",
  "hit by the Argama's attack,",
  "fell back.",
  "In the course of that battle,",
  "though, Reccoa Londe",
  "was carried off by Yazan",
  "to Scirocco.",
  "Kamille, knowing nothing of it,",
  "could only wail.",
  "The AEUG held an audience",
  "with Haman Karn,",
  "the representative of Axis,",
  "but the alliance talks failed.",
  "For its part, the AEUG",
  "was repelled by an Axis",
  "that was simply carrying on",
  "the last war unchanged,",
  "while Axis, from the start,",
  "had little intention",
  "of forming an alliance.",
  "At most, they meant to sell",
  "themselves at a high price;",
  "for now, they thought it enough",
  "just to show they were",
  "willing to negotiate.",
  "At least, the leadership",
  "believed so.",
  "That Haman, Axis's representative,",
  "merely wanted to catch Char's eye",
  "and, if she could,",
  "bring him to his knees,",
  "no one but she and Char",
  "had yet realized",
  "at the time."
 ]
}
